## Project Root

**`/Users/sinchunyeung/github/simplification-of-trajectory-streams`**

Web visualizer lives in `web/`; trace generation is in C++ (`simplify.cpp`) behind a Flask server (`web/server.py`).

---

## Key Files

| Role | Path |
|------|------|
| Frontend logic (load, preview, render) | `/Users/sinchunyeung/github/simplification-of-trajectory-streams/web/viewer.js` |
| Frontend UI / loading HUD CSS | `/Users/sinchunyeung/github/simplification-of-trajectory-streams/web/index.html` |
| Flask API | `/Users/sinchunyeung/github/simplification-of-trajectory-streams/web/server.py` |
| C++ trace JSON writer | `/Users/sinchunyeung/github/simplification-of-trajectory-streams/simplify.cpp` |
